      "en": "<b>Honest status:</b> Two weeks in. <b>Delivery recovered strongly over the weekend</b> — 7/24 (Fri) & 7/25 (Sat) each hit ~¥12,000/day (2× the daily budget cap). 6 reservation-actions so far (¥6,151 each). But whether completions came from the ad only started being measurable on 2026/07/24 — judge after 2–3 more weeks."
